                                         any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A             =
                                   &lt;strong&gt;=0A                             =
                       2. Connect your printer: Follow the instructions tha=
t=0A                                                    came with the print=
er to connect it to the network.=0A                                        =
        &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=
=0A                                                    If you have a Wi-Fi =
printer, you might need to connect=0A                                      =
              the printer to your Mac with a USB cable to set up Wi-Fi=0A  =
                                                  printing. After connectin=
g the printer to your Mac,=0A                                              =
      install the Mac software that came with the printer and=0A           =
                                         use the printer=E2=80=99s setup as=
sistant to connect the printer=0A                                          =
          to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you can=0A              =
                                      disconnect the cable from your printe=
r and Mac and the=0A                                                    pri=
nter should remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                      =
                          &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                       =
         &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    3. =
Add the printer to your list of available printers:=0A                     =
